{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1770949221, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "vLLM Semantic Router — Multi-Cloud Provider Routing (OpenAI, Anthropic)"}
[0.005854, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\r\n  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ║   vLLM Semantic Router — Multi-Cloud Provider Routing Demo        ║\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ║   Same model → different cloud providers with per-user auth       ║\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mArchitecture:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m┌──────────┐    ┌───────────────┐    ┌──────────────────┐    ┌──────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │ Envoy  :8801  │    │ Semantic Router  │ ─┬→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[32mOpenAI\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   api.openai.com │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│  Client  │ →  │               │ →  │ ext_proc :50051  │  │ └──────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │ ext_authz ────│──→ │                  │  │ ┌──────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │  Authorino    │    │                  │  ├→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[34mAzure\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  *.azure.com    │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │  :50052       │    │                  │  │ └──────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │               │    │                  │  │ ┌──────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │               │    │                  │  ├→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[35mAnthropic\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  api.anthr.. │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │               │    │                  │  │ └──────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │               │    │                  │  │ ┌──────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │    │               │    │                  │  └→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[33mLocal vLLM\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  :8000      │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m└──────────┘    └───────────────┘    └──────────────────┘    └──────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mProvider Profiles:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mProfile                Type             Base URL                     Auth Header         \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m──────────────────── ────────────── ────────────────────────── ──────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n  openai-prod            \u001b[32mopenai          \u001b[0m api.openai.com/v1            Authorization: Bearer\r\n  azure-east             \u001b[34mazure-openai    \u001b[0m *.openai.azure.com           api-key             \r\n  anthropic-prod         \u001b[35manthropic       \u001b[0m api.anthropic.com            x-api-key           \r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mUsers (from K8s Secrets):\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mUser           OpenAI Key               Azure Key                Anthropic Key       \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m──────────── ────────────────────── ────────────────────── ──────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n  alice          \u001b[32myes                     \u001b[0m \u001b[34myes             "]
[0.006259, "o", "        \u001b[0m \u001b[35myes                 \u001b[0m\r\n  bob            \u001b[32myes                     \u001b[0m \u001b[34myes                     \u001b[0m \u001b[2m—                 \u001b[0m\r\n  carol          \u001b[2m—                     \u001b[0m \u001b[2m—                     \u001b[0m \u001b[35myes                 \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mNOTE: All tokens are FAKE. Provider error messages prove correct routing.\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2me.g., OpenAI returns \"Incorrect API key provided: sk-proj-alice-...\",\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mproving the request reached OpenAI with Alice's key in the right format.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[3.006941, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mDiscovering user tokens from K8s Secrets...\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[3.145225, "o", "  user-alice: \u001b[2mmp-alice-token-1111...\u001b[0m\r\n  user-bob:   \u001b[2mmp-bob-token-2222...\u001b[0m\r\n  user-carol: \u001b[2mmp-carol-token-3333...\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[6.146796, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.147137, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m PART 1 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mMulti-Provider Routing — same model, different clouds\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Alice has keys for all providers. Requests route based on model name\r\n  and the endpoint's provider_profile determines which key to use.\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: provider-specific auth errors (fake keys → 401 from provider)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.148679, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.148956, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 1 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → gpt-4o (routes to OpenAI, uses openai key)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[10.150673, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.150968, "o", "  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-alice-token-1111...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is 2 + 2? Reply in one word.\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[11.295761, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n"]
[11.29581, "o", "  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    text/plain\r\n"]
[11.315668, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.334945, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n"]
[11.335038, "o", "  │       \"message\": \"Incorrect API key provided: sk-proj-************-key. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.\",\r\n  │       \"type\": \"invalid_request_error\",\r\n  │       \"code\": \"invalid_api_key\",\r\n"]
[11.335051, "o", "  │       \"param\": null\r\n"]
[11.335064, "o", "  │     },\r\n"]
[11.335081, "o", "  │     \"status\": 401\r\n"]
[11.335163, "o", "  │   }\r\n"]
[11.335183, "o", "  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[14.337451, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 2 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → claude-sonnet-4 (routes to Anthropic, uses anthropic key)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[15.338992, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-alice-token-1111...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is the capital of France? Reply in one word.\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.339063, "o", "\r\n"]
[16.420513, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    application/json\r\n"]
[16.441289, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.462121, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"type\": \"error\",\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n  │       \"type\": \"authentication_error\",\r\n  │       \"message\": \"invalid x-api-key\"\r\n  │     },\r\n  │     \"request_id\": \"req_011CY5GZYkCcHZrKTNdbCz7i\"\r\n  │   }\r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[19.464433, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[45m\u001b[97m PART 2 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mPer-User Key Isolation — same model, different user keys\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Both Alice and Bob request gpt-4o. Each user's request uses their own\r\n  OpenAI key (injected by Authorino from their K8s Secret).\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: different key fingerprints in the error messages.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[22.466334, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 3 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → gpt-4o (Alice's OpenAI key: sk-proj-alice-...)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[23.468077, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-alice-token-1111...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Say hello. Reply in 5 words.\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[24.561075, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    text/plain\r\n"]
[24.590543, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.610778, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n  │       \"message\": \"Incorrect API key provided: sk-proj-************-key. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.\",\r\n  │       \"type\": \"invalid_request_error\",\r\n  │       \"code\": \"invalid_api_key\",\r\n  │       \"param\": null\r\n  │     },\r\n  │     \"status\": 401\r\n  │   }\r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[27.613336, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 4 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mBob → gpt-4o (Bob's OpenAI key: sk-proj-bob-...)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[28.614778, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-bob-token-2222...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Say hello. Reply in 5 words.\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[29.705387, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    text/plain\r\n"]
[29.724453, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[29.743472, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n"]
[29.743506, "o", "  │       \"message\": \"Incorrect API key provided: sk-proj-**********-key. You can find your API key at https://platform.openai.com/account/api-keys.\",\r\n"]
[29.743666, "o", "  │       \"type\": \"invalid_request_error\",\r\n"]
[29.743751, "o", "  │       \"code\": \"invalid_api_key\",\r\n  │       \"param\": null\r\n  │     },\r\n  │     \"status\": 401\r\n  │   }\r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[32.746148, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[41m\u001b[97m PART 3 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mMissing Key Rejection — fail-closed per provider\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Carol only has an Anthropic key. Requesting gpt-4o requires an OpenAI key.\r\n  The router rejects with a credential error (no fallback, no silent failure).\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: router 500 with \"no credential found\" for openai provider.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[35.748052, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 5 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mCarol → gpt-4o (NO OpenAI key — expect router rejection)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[36.749368, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-carol-token-3333...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is 2 + 2?\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[37.772604, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 200\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     200\r\n"]
[37.772945, "o", "  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    application/json\r\n"]
[37.791953, "o", "  │\r\n"]
[37.79219, "o", "  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.811455, "o", "  │   {\r\n"]
[37.811717, "o", "  │     \"error\": {\r\n  │       \"code\": 401,\r\n  │       \"message\": \"Credential resolution failed for model gpt-4o: no credential found for provider openai (model=gpt-4o) after trying [header-injection → static-config] — all providers exhausted. Check: (1) your auth backend (Authorino, Envoy Gateway, etc.) is running and injecting the expected headers, (2) header names in authz.providers[].headers match what your auth backend injects, (3) model_config has access_key set if using static-config fallback. Set"]
[37.811754, "o", "\r\n"]
[37.811838, "o", "  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[37.811908, "o", "\r\n\r\n"]
[40.814439, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 6 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mCarol → claude-sonnet-4 (HAS Anthropic key — expect Anthropic auth error)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[41.815974, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m"]
[41.816308, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer mp-carol-token-3333...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-20250514\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is the capital of Japan? Reply in one word.\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[42.89089, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    application/json"]
[42.890932, "o", "\r\n"]
[42.911821, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[42.932567, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"type\": \"error\",\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n  │       \"type\": \"authentication_error\",\r\n  │       \"message\": \"invalid x-api-key\"\r\n  │     },\r\n  │     \"request_id\": \"req_011CY5GbVwLStphn3YHUBVMq\"\r\n  │   }\r\n"]
[42.932679, "o", "  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[45.93509, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[41m\u001b[97m PART 4 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAuthentication — Authorino rejects invalid tokens\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: HTTP 401/403 from Authorino (request never reaches router/provider).\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[48.936553, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 7 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mInvalid token → expect 401 from Authorino\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[49.938318, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-does-n...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"This should fail\"}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[50.957944, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n"]
[51.04656, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.066994, "o", "  │   \r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[54.069309, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 8 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mNo token → expect 401 from Authorino\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[55.07102, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST (no Authorization header)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"gpt-4o\", ...}'\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[56.082602, "o", "  \u001b[1mRESPONSE — HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n"]
[56.082639, "o", "  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │\r\n"]
[56.103824, "o", "  │   \r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[59.106569, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mSummary — Multi-Cloud Provider Routing\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  The same router instance handles \u001b[1mmultiple cloud LLM providers\u001b[0m.\r\n  Provider-specific auth (header name, prefix, path) is driven by \u001b[1mprovider_profiles\u001b[0m.\r\n  API keys come from \u001b[1mAuthorino\u001b[0m (K8s Secrets → header injection).\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat the error messages prove:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m OpenAI errors mention \"sk-proj-alice-...\" → correct key, correct provider\r\n    \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Anthropic errors say \"invalid x-api-key\" → correct auth header format\r\n    \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Alice vs Bob get different key fingerprints → per-user isolation\r\n    \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Carol → gpt-4o gets router rejection → fail-closed, no fallback\r\n    \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Invalid/no token → Authorino 401 → never reaches provider\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mKey files:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mRouter config:  config/testing/config.multi-provider.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mEnvoy config:   scripts/demo-multi-provider/envoy.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mAuthConfig:     scripts/demo-multi-provider/k8s-authconfig.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mSecrets:        scripts/demo-multi-provider/k8s-secrets.yaml\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
